"id": 1414674, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scubki.jpg"}, {"id": 1339357, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scspgd.jpg"}, {"id": 1339366, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scspgm.jpg"}, {"id": 1339355, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scspgb.jpg"}], "slug": "call-of-duty-black-ops-6", "storyline": "During Operation Desert Storm, CIA operatives Troy Marshall and William \"\"Case\"\" Calderon are deployed to the Iraq-Kuwait border to extract an Iraqi official. The mission goes sideways when the target claims he is being hunted by a shadowy paramilitary force called Pantheon. After the extraction fails, a rogue former agent named Russell Adler surfaces with a cryptic message pointing to an old KGB safe house in Bulgaria.\n\nSuspended from duty and with no official support, Marshall, Case, and veteran operative Frank Woods assemble a team of outcasts, including an ex-Stasi technician and a skilled assassin. As they dig into Pantheon's operations, they uncover links between the group and CIA leadership itself, along with a dangerous psychochemical weapon called the Cradle. Declared fugitives after being framed for a Pantheon attack, the team must unravel a conspiracy that reaches into the highest levels of American intelligence.", "summary": "Call of Duty: Black Ops 6 is a first-person shooter co-developed by Treyarch and Raven Software, published by Activision in October 2024. It is the seventh entry in the Black Ops sub-series, set during the early 1990s Gulf War era. The game features a single-player campaign, competitive multiplayer with an omnidirectional movement system allowing players to sprint, dive, and slide in any direction, and a cooperative round-based Zombies mode. It had the longest development cycle in Call of Duty history at four years, during which the team rebuilt core Black Ops systems in a new shared engine.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 39, "name": "Warfare"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/call-of-duty-black-ops-6", "videos": [{"id": 114429, "name": "Teaser", "video_id": "V08UPqchVgQ", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=V08UPqchVgQ", "title": "Black Ops 6: 'The Truth Lies' - Live Action Reveal Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/V08UPqchVgQ/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 123426, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "dqEvH7TBSnA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dqEvH7TBSnA", "title": "Call of Duty: Black Ops 6 World Premiere Trailer | GAMESCOM Opening Night Live 2024", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/dqEvH7TBSnA/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 1956, "name": "Call of Duty: Black Ops"}, {"id": 107, "name": "Call of Duty"}]}